 <section class="white-box frequently-asked-questions" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
          <span class="section-label">FAQs</span>
          <h2 class="section-title" id="faq-heading">Frequently Asked Questions About H Rishabraj Astral</h2>
          <div class="faq-box">
            
            <article class="faq-item active">
              <h3 class="faq-header">
                <button type="button" id="faq-question-1" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="faq-answer-1">What amenities can residents enjoy at H Rishabraj Astral? <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </button>
              </h3>
              <div class="faq-body" id="faq-answer-1" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-1">
                <p>Residents at H Rishabraj Astral can enjoy amenities such as kids play areas, power backup, 24 x 7 security, a central green park, and indoor games.</p>
              </div>
            </article>
            
            <article class="faq-item">
              <h3 class="faq-header">
                <button type="button" id="faq-question-2" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-2">Who is the developer behind H Rishabraj Astral? <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </button>
              </h3>
              <div class="faq-body" id="faq-answer-2" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-2">
                <p>The developer of H Rishabraj Astral is H Rishabraj Builders and Developers, known for completing a total of 47 projects.</p>
              </div>
            </article>
            
            <article class="faq-item">
              <h3 class="faq-header">
                <button type="button" id="faq-question-3" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-3">What is the current status of construction at H Rishabraj Astral? <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </button>
              </h3>
              <div class="faq-body" id="faq-answer-3" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-3">
                <p>The current status of construction at H Rishabraj Astral is that it is a new launch.</p>
              </div>
            </article>
            
            <article class="faq-item">
              <h3 class="faq-header">
                <button type="button" id="faq-question-4" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-4">What are the nearby landmarks to H Rishabraj Astral? <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </button>
              </h3>
              <div class="faq-body" id="faq-answer-4" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-4">
                <p>Nearby landmarks to H Rishabraj Astral include Citizen Bank bus stop (0.15 km), Narayana E Techno School (0.34 km), Chandra Maternity Hospital (0.22 km), and several restaurants and gyms within close proximity.</p>
              </div>
            </article>
            
            <article class="faq-item">
              <h3 class="faq-header">
                <button type="button" id="faq-question-5" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-5">What type of flooring and wall finishes are provided in H Rishabraj Astral? <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </button>
              </h3>
              <div class="faq-body" id="faq-answer-5" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-5">
                <p>In H Rishabraj Astral, the master bedroom features oil bound distemper on the walls and vitrified tiles on the flooring, while the other bedrooms and living areas also have vitrified tiles and oil bound distemper for the walls.</p>
              </div>
            </article>
            
            <article class="faq-item">
              <h3 class="faq-header">
                <button type="button" id="faq-question-6" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-6">Where is Astral placed within Borivali West? <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </button>
              </h3>
              <div class="faq-body" id="faq-answer-6" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-6">
                <p>In the established IC Colony, just 800 m from Mandapeshwar Metro and the low-traffic New Link Road.</p>
              </div>
            </article>
            
            <article class="faq-item">
              <h3 class="faq-header">
                <button type="button" id="faq-question-7" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-7">Is it RERA approved? <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </button>
              </h3>
              <div class="faq-body" id="faq-answer-7" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-7">
                <p>Yes, H Rishabraj Astral is RERA registered with RERA number P51800077784, is registered and on record</p>
              </div>
            </article>
            
            <article class="faq-item">
              <h3 class="faq-header">
                <button type="button" id="faq-question-8" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-8">What amenities will be on offer? <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </button>
              </h3>
              <div class="faq-body" id="faq-answer-8" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-8">
                <p>Features a gymnasium, kids' play area, yoga/meditation zone, gazebo, walking track, indoor games, central green park, along with security and utility backup.</p>
              </div>
            </article>
            
            <article class="faq-item">
              <h3 class="faq-header">
                <button type="button" id="faq-question-9" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-9">How is the connectivity? <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </button>
              </h3>
              <div class="faq-body" id="faq-answer-9" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-9">
                <p>Excellent connectivity with metros, trains, and buses around; also close to New Link Road, schools, hospitals, shopping.</p>
              </div>
            </article>
            
          </div>
      </section>


