t for early morning walks.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Nupur"},"datePublished":"2025-06-30","reviewBody":"Only one tower. I think it will create fear of elevator waiting times during peak days.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":3,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Shaswata"},"datePublished":"2025-06-30","reviewBody":"No sports court or swimming pool, I think it is restrictive for health-conscious buyers.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":3,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1}}]},{"@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/h-rishabraj-astral/325598/project#faq","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/h-rishabraj-astral/325598/project#webpage"},"mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What amenities can residents enjoy at H Rishabraj Astral?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Residents at H Rishabraj Astral can enjoy amenities such as kids play areas, power backup, 24 x 7 security, a central green park, and indoor games."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Who is the developer behind H Rishabraj Astral?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The developer of H Rishabraj Astral is H Rishabraj Builders and Developers, known for completing a total of 47 projects."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the current status of construction at H Rishabraj Astral?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The current status of construction at H Rishabraj Astral is that it is a new launch."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What are the nearby landmarks to H Rishabraj Astral?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Nearby landmarks to H Rishabraj Astral include Citizen Bank bus stop (0.15 km), Narayana E Techno School (0.34 km), Chandra Maternity Hospital (0.22 km), and several restaurants and gyms within close proximity."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What type of flooring and wall finishes are provided in H Rishabraj Astral?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"In H Rishabraj Astral, the master bedroom features oil bound distemper on the walls and vitrified tiles on the flooring, while the other bedrooms and living areas also have vitrified tiles and oil bound distemper for the walls."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Where is Astral placed within Borivali West?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"In the established IC Colony, just 800 m from Mandapeshwar Metro and the low-traffic New Link Road."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is it RERA approved?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, H Rishabraj Astral is RERA registered with RERA number P51800077784, is registered and on record"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What amenities will be on offer?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Features a gymnasium, kids' play area, yoga/meditation zone, gazebo, walking track, indoor games, central green park, along with security and utility backup."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How is the connectivity?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Excellent connectivity with metros, trains, and buses around; also close to New Link Road, schools, hospitals, shopping."}}]}]}</script>

